the move move with a node is legal at a time if
    a second node is a location at the time
    and the second node is the connected of the node.

the goal of robot is a number at a time if
    the number is a score at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    20 is a step at the time.

when the move move with a node is made
    and a second node is a location
then the node is a location
    and it is not the case that the second node is a location.

when the move move with a node is made
then the node is visited.

when the move move with a node is made
    and a thing is a step
    and the successor of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the thing is a step.

when the move move with a node is made
    and it is not the case that the node is visited
    and a thing is a score
    and the scorenext of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is a score
    and it is not the case that the thing is a score.

it must not be true that
    the move move with a node is made
    and it is not the case that the move move with the node is legal.

initially "a" is a location
    and "a" is visited
    and 1 is a score
    and 1 is a step
    and robot is a control.

